        'Component Fixation & Bearing Seating: Definitive cobalt-chromium femoral and titanium tibial components are cemented securely with antibiotic-loaded surgical bone cement; a high-density polyethylene bearing insert is locked into place, and the patella is assessed for resurfacing or denervation before layered wound closure.'
